{
    "title": "Drone Remote Control",
    "description": "Do you want to take control of your drone? Now it's possible with Drone Remote Control\r\nUse a smartphone to fly a drone with our Drone Remote Control app.\r\nDrone remote controller for all drones,\r\neasily convert your android phone into drone remote controller. It's simple and easy to set up and use, the way of use\r\nis exactly the same as RC Drone.\r\nDo you want to take control of your friends' drones? now you can do it with Drone Remote Control, that's when the real fun will start to happen.\r\nThe drone remote control is a tool that can replace your physical rc drone. you can control the drone with camera with the universal drone remote control for all.\r\nTry this amazing and free universal drone remote control app to turn your Android device into a remote control for drones.\r\nCompatible with the latest drones and not compatible with some older hardware:\r\n- Easily make flight plans on any device\r\n- Automate takeoff, flight, image capture and landing\r\n- Live view streaming First Person Shooting (FPV)\r\n- Disable auto-flight and regain control with one click\r\n- Easily continue uninterrupted flights to map large areas\r\n- Drone controller with video.\r\n- Drone controller with FPS capture\r\n- Use the APP to remote your drone, you can receive the view from the drone and take photos, record videos, control the drone.\r\nAs you can imagine, this is the best way to fool anyone obsessed with drones like quadcopters or other drone models in general.\r\nIf you know such a person, then the perfect thing you can do is go ahead and install Drone Remote Control.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you want to take control of your drone? Now it&#39;s possible with Drone Remote Control<br>Use a smartphone to fly a drone with our Drone Remote Control app.<br>Drone remote controller for all drones,<br>easily convert your android phone into drone remote controller. It&#39;s simple and easy to set up and use, the way of use<br>is exactly the same as RC Drone.<br>Do you want to take control of your friends&#39; drones? now you can do it with Drone Remote Control, that&#39;s when the real fun will start to happen.<br>The drone remote control is a tool that can replace your physical rc drone. you can control the drone with camera with the universal drone remote control for all.<br>Try this amazing and free universal drone remote control app to turn your Android device into a remote control for drones.<br>Compatible with the latest drones and not compatible with some older hardware:<br>- Easily make flight plans on any device<br>- Automate takeoff, flight, image capture and landing<br>- Live view streaming First Person Shooting (FPV)<br>- Disable auto-flight and regain control with one click<br>- Easily continue uninterrupted flights to map large areas<br>- Drone controller with video.<br>- Drone controller with FPS capture<br>- Use the APP to remote your drone, you can receive the view from the drone and take photos, record videos, control the drone.<br>As you can imagine, this is the best way to fool anyone obsessed with drones like quadcopters or other drone models in general.<br>If you know such a person, then the perfect thing you can do is go ahead and install Drone Remote Control.",
